==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s (200%) spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Metal Doge]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Metal Doge]]s (200%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns.

